{
  "body_human_readable": "Here is the GDP forecast data for 2023 and 2024 for India, China, Brazil, Japan, and the United States:\n\n- **India**: \n  - 2023: 8.2%\n  - 2024: 6.5%\n  *(Note: For India, data and projections are presented on a fiscal year basis, with FY 2023/24 shown in the 2023 column.)* [1] [2]\n\n- **China**: \n  - 2023: 5.2%\n  - 2024: 4.8% [1]\n\n- **Brazil**: \n  - 2023: 3.2%\n  - 2024: 3.7% [1]\n\n- **Japan**: \n  - 2023: 1.5%\n  - 2024: -0.2% [1]\n\n- **United States**: \n  - 2023: 2.9%\n  - 2024: 2.8% [1]\n\nThese figures represent the estimated real GDP growth rates for each country for the years 2023 and 2024.",
